WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:07.900
Lumiose City is under attack

2
00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:11.966
by the sudden appearance of destructive creeping vines everywhere.

3
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.800
An attack masterminded by Lysandre and Team Flare

4
00:00:15.866 --> 00:00:18.300
using the Legendary Pokémon Zygarde.

5
00:00:18.366 --> 00:00:22.100
While Clemont, Bonnie and Serena were heading to Prism Tower,

6
00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:24.366
Ash was taken captive there.

7
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.133
And Squishy, seeing the destruction of Lumiose City,

8
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.300
has transformed into Zygarde.

9
00:00:30.733 --> 00:00:35.700
Now it stands before the other Zygarde, who is under Team Flare's control,

10
00:00:35.766 --> 00:00:38.333
in order to stop this vicious rampage.

11
00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:55.200
Wow, Squishy... is Zygarde?

12
00:01:00.933 --> 00:01:03.400
Yes. Zygarde is the Legendary Pokémon

13
00:01:03.466 --> 00:01:04.866
who watches over the world

14
00:01:04.933 --> 00:01:07.900
and punishes those who dare to disrupt its order.

15
00:01:09.466 --> 00:01:14.266
You are witnessing the rage of Zygarde, as well as Team Flare.

16
00:01:14.666 --> 00:01:17.066
This world will start over again.

17
00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:21.833
Soon the other Zygarde will come around to our way of thinking.

18
00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:24.433
Then it will turn red with rage.

19
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.766
No, you're wrong!

20
00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.600
Squishy would never think like that!

21
00:01:28.666 --> 00:01:30.333
Pika, Pika!

22
00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.433
Alain!

23
00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:34.500
What's going on with all this? Say something!

24
00:01:37.566 --> 00:01:41.566
Look. At the center of the vines winding their way through Lumiose

25
00:01:41.633 --> 00:01:45.000
are two giant Pokémon. It is believed they are Zygarde,

26
00:01:45.066 --> 00:01:46.633
the Legendary Pokémon.

27
00:01:58.066 --> 00:01:59.633
-Squishy, no!

28
00:02:00.133 --> 00:02:01.900
Stop getting distracted!

29
00:02:01.966 --> 00:02:04.566
Druddigon, use dark pulse.

30
00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.466
That was a close one.

31
00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:16.600
- Professor Sycamore.
- Mairin.

32
00:02:17.033 --> 00:02:18.833
What? I thought...

33
00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:20.100
That little brat.

34
00:02:20.533 --> 00:02:21.933
Professor, look.

35
00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:24.600
Zygarde.

36
00:02:28.733 --> 00:02:30.166
That is enough!

37
00:02:30.733 --> 00:02:32.133
Now, wake up!

38
00:02:38.966 --> 00:02:42.266
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

39
00:02:43.033 --> 00:02:46.200
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

40
00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:50.100
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

41
00:02:50.166 --> 00:02:52.766
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

42
00:02:53.366 --> 00:02:54.533
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

43
00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.666
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

44
00:02:57.733 --> 00:03:00.966
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

45
00:03:01.033 --> 00:03:02.700
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

46
00:03:20.766 --> 00:03:21.966
Squishy!

47
00:03:22.033 --> 00:03:25.733
Zygarde, please listen to what Squishy's telling you!

48
00:03:27.533 --> 00:03:29.266
Mega-Evolved Pokémon.

49
00:03:29.666 --> 00:03:31.466
Might be more of a challenge.

50
00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:35.266
Liepard, use shadow claw!

51
00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:37.733
Blaziken, use blaze kick.

52
00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.866
Blaziken!

53
00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:42.900
Help us out, Bunnelby and Chespin.

54
00:03:43.466 --> 00:03:44.800
Go, Heliolisk.

55
00:03:46.766 --> 00:03:47.600
All set?

56
00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:50.933
Luxray, use wild charge.

57
00:03:51.333 --> 00:03:52.533
Dodge it!

58
00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:54.900
Chespin, use pin missile.

59
00:03:54.966 --> 00:03:56.966
Heliolisk, use dragon tail.

60
00:03:57.033 --> 00:03:58.333
Chespin!

61
00:04:03.233 --> 00:04:05.200
Now, Liepard, dark pulse.

62
00:04:05.266 --> 00:04:06.133
Liepard!

63
00:04:06.566 --> 00:04:07.666
Use mud shot.

64
00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.866
Blaziken, use flamethrower!

65
00:04:13.333 --> 00:04:16.133
Druddigon, dodge and use dragon claw!

66
00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:19.133
Druddigon!

67
00:04:21.233 --> 00:04:24.166
Serena. Did you see Alain and Ash?

68
00:04:24.233 --> 00:04:26.900
They said they were going to Prism Tower.

69
00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:29.500
Not yet. I haven't seen them.

70
00:04:29.566 --> 00:04:31.400
If something bad happened...

71
00:04:31.466 --> 00:04:35.533
Don't worry about Alain and Ash. You know they're both strong.

72
00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.466
Huh?

73
00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.800
I'm still so worried about Chespie, too.

74
00:04:40.866 --> 00:04:42.166
Aw.

75
00:04:42.233 --> 00:04:44.666
Chespie's been asleep for quite a while.

76
00:04:45.633 --> 00:04:46.866
It won't wake up.

77
00:04:48.033 --> 00:04:50.200
Oh, no. Mairin, I'm so sorry.

78
00:04:50.633 --> 00:04:55.666
Don't be. It'll be fine. Right now, Chespie's being treated at Lysandre Labs.

79
00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:57.133
They're awesome.

80
00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:00.266
If there's anything we can do, just let us know.

81
00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:02.333
We'll do whatever we can to help.

82
00:05:08.966 --> 00:05:12.300
Mairin? Chespie's at Lysandre Labs, right?

83
00:05:12.366 --> 00:05:13.500
Yeah. Right.

84
00:05:13.933 --> 00:05:14.966
Clemont?

85
00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:17.966
Of course you should go. Don't worry.

86
00:05:18.033 --> 00:05:22.233
We can handle everything around here. Take care of Mairin and Chespie.

87
00:05:22.666 --> 00:05:24.066
Clemont, thanks!

88
00:05:24.133 --> 00:05:26.600
Let's go. Chespie needs us.

89
00:05:26.666 --> 00:05:27.733
Okay.

90
00:05:28.166 --> 00:05:31.200
I'll go, too. I've got a car at the back of the lab.

91
00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:36.500
I don't know what you're up to, but we will not be ignored.

92
00:05:36.566 --> 00:05:38.766
Liepard, shadow claw!

93
00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.100
Liepard!

94
00:05:43.933 --> 00:05:46.666
- All right, let's go.
- Thanks, Clemont.

95
00:05:46.733 --> 00:05:50.033
- Blaziken Mask, take care of this.
- Leave it to me.

96
00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:53.300
Well, then, I guess we'll just leave them to Celosia.

97
00:05:53.366 --> 00:05:56.466
That leaves us to do our job the way we always do.

98
00:05:56.900 --> 00:06:00.966
I remind you, you're up against the leader of the Lumiose Gym.

99
00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.333
Lysandre Labs?

100
00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:07.266
Could that be the glasses gang's secret base?

101
00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:10.500
Could be. We don't need glasses to look.

102
00:06:14.233 --> 00:06:16.566
Alain? This is all thanks to you.

103
00:06:17.066 --> 00:06:19.633
Mega Evolution energy gives us power.

104
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.900
The power to control Zygarde.

105
00:06:28.566 --> 00:06:32.666
The Mega Evolution energy you gathered is proving to be quite useful

106
00:06:32.733 --> 00:06:35.033
in destroying this imperfect world.

107
00:06:36.566 --> 00:06:37.766
Just look.

108
00:06:38.433 --> 00:06:41.100
There is no tomorrow for this world.

109
00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:45.666
When the sun rises next, it will be brand-new.

110
00:06:45.733 --> 00:06:48.933
How beautiful the end of this world is.

111
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:52.600
We are truly taking the first step towards peace.

112
00:07:05.766 --> 00:07:06.900
Alain.

113
00:07:09.033 --> 00:07:11.266
Mairin. Chespie.

114
00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:15.000
Is this the reason I had all those battles?

115
00:07:15.666 --> 00:07:17.833
All of them for this?!

116
00:07:20.733 --> 00:07:21.566
This?!

117
00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.033
This?!

118
00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:27.533
You see, Chespie's been asleep for quite a while.

119
00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:28.933
It won't wake up.

120
00:07:29.633 --> 00:07:33.133
That's it. That's why Alain did this.

121
00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.700
For Chespie's sake.

122
00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:37.133
For Mairin's sake, too.

123
00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.366
Your wish had pure intent.

124
00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:42.433
A truly noble wish, indeed.

125
00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:51.466
Hold on. What are you doing in such a dangerous place?

126
00:07:51.533 --> 00:07:55.200
We have to go to Lysandre Labs. My precious Chespie is there.

127
00:07:55.633 --> 00:07:57.966
You jest! Why, that's terrible.

128
00:07:58.033 --> 00:07:59.433
So, step on the gas.

129
00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.300
We happen to be from Lumiose City TV!

130
00:08:02.366 --> 00:08:07.266
Perfect timing. Where to? We'll whisk you there in our news copter.

131
00:08:07.333 --> 00:08:09.866
- That'd be a big help.
- Thanks so much.

132
00:08:09.933 --> 00:08:11.533
Think nothing of it.

133
00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:13.800
A friend in need is a friend indeed.

134
00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.800
Blue yonder, here we come.

135
00:08:21.866 --> 00:08:25.100
And what are we heading for? Team Flare's secret base.

136
00:08:25.166 --> 00:08:26.600
Wait. What did you say?

137
00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:31.600
I said you've got flair and a lucky face.

138
00:08:41.566 --> 00:08:44.600
Squishy, I hope it hears you.

139
00:08:44.666 --> 00:08:46.400
- And your heart.
- Dedenne!

140
00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:58.566
- Oh, Squishy!
- Denne.

141
00:08:58.633 --> 00:08:59.466
Okay.

142
00:09:03.066 --> 00:09:04.000
Hurry up!

143
00:09:04.066 --> 00:09:05.366
Thank you, Diantha.

144
00:09:06.233 --> 00:09:07.366
Champion!

145
00:09:08.433 --> 00:09:11.000
Diantha, you've got to let us help you.

146
00:09:11.066 --> 00:09:11.966
Sawyer!

147
00:09:12.033 --> 00:09:14.333
We can't just stand by and watch.

148
00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.966
- Yeah, we wanna help you.
- Please, Diantha?

149
00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:23.400
In that case, rescuing children and the elderly comes first.

150
00:09:23.833 --> 00:09:25.100
Can you bring them here?

151
00:09:26.066 --> 00:09:28.033
- All right!
- We'll take care of it.

152
00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:30.700
- All right.
- You can count on us.

153
00:09:36.966 --> 00:09:38.600
♪ If we take control ♪

154
00:09:38.666 --> 00:09:40.300
♪ Of their secret base ♪

155
00:09:40.366 --> 00:09:44.400
♪ Team Rocket is copping the keys to Kalos We'll be running the place ♪

156
00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.300
It won't be long before you become ours, as well.

157
00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:18.433
So, Ash, I'm going to use your Bond Phenomenon

158
00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.866
in service to my new world.

159
00:10:21.333 --> 00:10:25.366
You're able to gain that powerful strength without a Key Stone,

160
00:10:25.433 --> 00:10:27.333
purely through your bond.

161
00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:29.833
When I saw that, I was thrilled.

162
00:10:30.266 --> 00:10:35.166
Ash, you have shown me there are limitless possibilities with Pokémon still.

163
00:10:35.233 --> 00:10:37.800
And I want that power for myself.

164
00:10:48.966 --> 00:10:53.466
The energy from this light is powerful enough to control Zygarde.

165
00:10:53.533 --> 00:10:56.333
But now, Ash, now, Greninja,

166
00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:59.766
I'm also going to control your Bond Phenomenon.

167
00:11:00.266 --> 00:11:01.333
No way.

168
00:11:01.766 --> 00:11:06.066
From this point on, both of you will answer to me.

169
00:11:07.866 --> 00:11:09.833
Pika!

170
00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:11.133
Lucha.

171
00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:13.366
- Goodra.
- Flame!

172
00:11:16.433 --> 00:11:19.166
Lysandre, please stop this!

173
00:11:19.866 --> 00:11:21.400
Pika, Pi!

174
00:11:25.133 --> 00:11:28.700
There's no way you're ever gonna control the two of us.

175
00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:32.100
You still don't understand, do you, Ash?

176
00:11:32.166 --> 00:11:34.700
When the current world becomes a thing of the past,

177
00:11:34.766 --> 00:11:39.133
you two will become the chosen ones who will guide all of humanity.

178
00:11:39.566 --> 00:11:41.866
We're never gonna become any of that.

179
00:11:41.933 --> 00:11:44.466
We're not ever gonna change. Alain!

180
00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:49.766
I don't know what happened to you, but you've gotta stop all this, now!

181
00:11:50.166 --> 00:11:52.366
I don't care about what you've done.

182
00:11:52.433 --> 00:11:55.766
I-- I believe in the Alain I know.

183
00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:58.066
I really care about this world.

184
00:11:58.666 --> 00:12:01.966
I care about the people and Pokémon who call this world home,

185
00:12:02.033 --> 00:12:04.600
and you won't destroy it! No way!

186
00:12:09.733 --> 00:12:11.666
Battle me, Lysandre!

187
00:12:19.433 --> 00:12:21.466
Who's that Pokémon?

188
00:12:26.033 --> 00:12:29.066
It's Zygarde 50 percent forme!

189
00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:43.366
Greninja!

190
00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.066
Ash, no. Are you okay?

191
00:13:02.466 --> 00:13:03.366
Alain.

192
00:13:03.933 --> 00:13:06.233
Truly brilliant.

193
00:13:06.666 --> 00:13:09.300
Mega Evolution energy can't stop your bond.

194
00:13:10.966 --> 00:13:13.733
Because of you, my head is clear.

195
00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:14.633
Awesome.

196
00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:18.366
We've got to stop this. Together!

197
00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:19.966
Now you're talking.

198
00:13:21.933 --> 00:13:23.933
Charizard, let's go!

199
00:13:25.466 --> 00:13:28.100
Use dragon claw to free Pikachu and the rest.

200
00:13:31.833 --> 00:13:33.066
Pika!

201
00:13:33.133 --> 00:13:34.833
You ready to do this?

202
00:13:37.266 --> 00:13:40.300
Do you honestly think you can defeat me?

203
00:13:40.366 --> 00:13:42.933
We must. We're going to prove to you

204
00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:46.600
that protecting someone takes real strength. By beating you!

205
00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.033
Alain, you really disappoint me.

206
00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:54.233
None of you will be needed in the new world I'm creating.

207
00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:58.000
Needed or not needed. Who are you to make that decision?

208
00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:00.266
I've got no choice.

209
00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.633
You will be stopped.

210
00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:16.500
And I'll do it myself.

211
00:14:21.033 --> 00:14:23.133
Liepard, use shadow claw.

212
00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:25.600
And Druddigon, use dragon claw.

213
00:14:28.366 --> 00:14:30.933
Heliolisk, use flash.

214
00:14:32.633 --> 00:14:34.766
- Luxray, use wild charge.
- Ray!

215
00:14:36.933 --> 00:14:40.033
Chespin, pin missile. Bunnelby, mud shot.

216
00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.733
Bunnelby!

217
00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:44.633
Chespin!

218
00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.833
- Druddigon!
- Liepard!

219
00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:49.966
Now, return.

220
00:14:53.966 --> 00:14:55.633
- Hey!
- Let me go!

221
00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:59.966
- Targets have been captured.
- Excellent job, Clembot.

222
00:15:00.466 --> 00:15:03.133
- This is your fault.
- No, this is your fault.

223
00:15:03.766 --> 00:15:04.633
Hmph.

224
00:15:09.266 --> 00:15:10.100
Squishy!

225
00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:15.833
Huh?

226
00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.566
Denne!

227
00:15:37.333 --> 00:15:40.233
Young lady, why were you there all alone?

228
00:15:42.066 --> 00:15:45.200
I'm scared Squishy's-- Squishy's gonna lose.

229
00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:54.600
- No! Squishy, no! No!
- What's going on, Bonnie?

230
00:15:55.366 --> 00:15:57.666
What happened to my Squishy?

231
00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.933
True success.

232
00:16:05.866 --> 00:16:10.100
Lysandre, the other Zygarde is under our control now.

233
00:16:10.533 --> 00:16:12.466
- It can't be.
- Pika?

234
00:16:14.666 --> 00:16:17.966
My world of peace will be created much faster now.

235
00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:21.966
How can you say that peace has anything to do with this?

236
00:16:22.033 --> 00:16:24.700
What would you know about peace?

237
00:16:25.333 --> 00:16:28.800
You don't have a clue when it comes to the ugly parts of this world.

238
00:16:35.233 --> 00:16:38.733
There once was a time when I reached out to help people.

239
00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:41.233
People who were in need and suffering.

240
00:16:44.166 --> 00:16:46.300
And they rejoiced.

241
00:16:46.366 --> 00:16:48.333
But that didn't last long.

242
00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:53.700
They began to take my help for granted, expected it like they had some right.

243
00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:59.566
The people only became louder and louder with their demands,

244
00:16:59.633 --> 00:17:03.333
and my help actually brought about their arrogance.

245
00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:08.300
Foolish, arrogant people.

246
00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:13.300
It would only be a matter of time before their world would be destroyed

247
00:17:13.366 --> 00:17:14.966
by their entitlement.

248
00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:18.333
That's why I'm going to create a new world.

249
00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:20.433
A world of peace.

250
00:17:21.099 --> 00:17:23.000
It's time for a new start.

251
00:17:23.599 --> 00:17:26.400
To create my utopian dream.

252
00:17:26.833 --> 00:17:30.000
But that dream has no room for you!

253
00:17:33.466 --> 00:17:34.700
Pyroar!

254
00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.600
Gyarados and Pyroar.

255
00:17:39.033 --> 00:17:42.966
Now, Gyarados, release your Mega Evolution energy!

256
00:17:54.733 --> 00:17:58.700
Respond to my heart, Key Stone! Beyond Evolution!

257
00:17:59.233 --> 00:18:00.466
Mega Evolve!

258
00:18:13.366 --> 00:18:14.933
Okay, let's do this.

259
00:18:19.933 --> 00:18:21.000
Over there.

260
00:18:25.366 --> 00:18:26.500
Hmm?

261
00:18:26.566 --> 00:18:28.800
Oh, you're back. How was Lumiose?

262
00:18:29.533 --> 00:18:32.433
It was a real festival of vines.

263
00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:34.233
Too bad you had to stay here.

264
00:18:34.666 --> 00:18:35.800
Mable?

265
00:18:35.866 --> 00:18:37.033
Huh?

266
00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:38.866
A media copter is approaching.

267
00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:41.133
Media copter?

268
00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:44.633
You know the drill. Let's give our guests a warm welcome.

269
00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.300
It appears that the lock code has been changed.

270
00:18:53.733 --> 00:18:54.966
I can handle this.

271
00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:01.100
Analyzing all possible codes.

272
00:19:10.133 --> 00:19:13.233
Pyroar and Gyarados, use incinerate.

273
00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:17.833
Pikachu and Goodra, use thunderbolt and dragon pulse.

274
00:19:18.266 --> 00:19:20.766
Pikachu!

275
00:19:20.833 --> 00:19:22.400
Goodra!

276
00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:27.000
Greninja, use cut.

277
00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:30.933
All right, Pyroar, use hyper beam.

278
00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.633
Noivern, boomburst!

279
00:19:38.733 --> 00:19:41.033
Charizard, dragon claw, let's go.

280
00:19:44.133 --> 00:19:46.333
Gyarados, use stone edge!

281
00:19:50.333 --> 00:19:53.366
Noivern and Hawlucha, use dragon claw and karate chop.

282
00:19:53.433 --> 00:19:54.266
Hacha!

283
00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:58.333
All right, Pyroar, use fire fang.

284
00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:04.366
Pikachu, use thunderbolt, now!

285
00:20:04.433 --> 00:20:07.900
Pikachu!

286
00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:19.433
In the face of great danger,

287
00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:23.000
everyone is doing what they can, battling in their own ways.

288
00:20:24.733 --> 00:20:26.733
What will become of Ash and Alain

289
00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:28.400
as they face off against Lysandre?

290
00:20:28.833 --> 00:20:31.266
We're not gonna let you win.

291
00:20:31.333 --> 00:20:32.966
We'll save Squishy.

292
00:20:33.033 --> 00:20:35.900
Your selfishness will not destroy the world!

293
00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:42.333
The greatest threat in Kalos history is about to move

294
00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:47.100
into an even more critical stage, as the journey continues.
